[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-KV-STORE
TITLE: Key-Value Store

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-61
TITLE: Key-Value Retrieval
STATEMENT: >>>
The Member Frontend Key-Value Store SHALL retrieve the value for a requested key from the Unified Backend key-value store.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Global website data lives in the Unified Backend key-value store. The Member Frontend Key-Value Store fetches that value so other Member Frontend services can use it.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-82
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-119
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-62
TITLE: Key-Value Absence
STATEMENT: >>>
When the Unified Backend key-value store has no entry for the requested key, the Member Frontend Key-Value Store SHALL provide no value.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A missing key is not an error for the Member Frontend shell. Callers treat the absent value as empty until the store has an entry.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-82
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-119
  ROLE: Refines

